BT /F1 11 Tf 54 730 Td 15 TL
(Machine Learning Foundations and Deep Neural Architectures) Tj T*
(Faculty of Computer Science and Artificial Intelligence) Tj T*
(1. Gradient Descent Optimization \(Inhidar Al-Tadarruj\)) Tj T*
(The parameter update equation for weight matrix W under gradient descent is:) Tj T*
(W_{t+1} = W_t - eta * nabla_W L\(W_t\)) Tj T*
(where eta represents the learning rate and L denotes the scalar loss objective.) Tj T*
(2. Mean Squared Error and Cross-Entropy Loss) Tj T*
(MSE Loss = \(1 / N\) * sum_{i=1}^N \(y_i - y_hat_i\)^2) Tj T*
(Cross-Entropy Loss = - sum_{i=1}^C y_i * log\(y_hat_i\)) Tj T*
(Table 1: Activation function characteristics and vanishing gradient behavior.) Tj T*
(Function | Equation | Range | Gradient at Extreme) Tj T*
(Sigmoid  | 1 / \(1 + exp\(-z\)\) | \(0, 1\) | Zero \(Vanishing\)) Tj T*
(Tanh     | \(exp\(z\) - exp\(-z\)\) / \(exp\(z\) + exp\(-z\)\) | \(-1, 1\) | Zero \(Vanishing\)) Tj T*
(ReLU     | max\(0, z\) | [0, inf\) | 1 for z > 0 \(Constant\)) Tj T*
(Figure 1 \(Page 1\): Multilayer perceptron architecture showing forward pass and backpropagation.) Tj T*
